[🤖 Claude Code] Agreed, adopted as a requirement. The tracker becomes a dashboard, not a log:

- a flow chart of the pipeline with the current step highlighted and each gate's state;
- a timeline chart of phases and gate waits (time working vs time waiting on you);
- a metrics table and charts: time per phase, comments answered, questions resolved n/m, agents and humanize passes used, doc quality trend;
- an append-only event log of everything that happened, with timestamps.

Charts are re-rendered from the run state on every transition. I am upgrading this run's tracker the same way now, and the spec will carry it.
